@startuml state_gesture_filter
!include _style.iuml
title State machine — gesture filter (debounce)

[*] --> IDLE

IDLE --> CANDIDATE : image [conf >= 0.8]\n/ cls = class, count = 1
IDLE --> IDLE : image [conf < 0.8]

CANDIDATE --> CANDIDATE : image [class == cls and conf >= 0.8]\n/ count++
CANDIDATE --> CANDIDATE : image [class != cls and conf >= 0.8]\n/ cls = class, count = 1
CANDIDATE --> IDLE : image [conf < 0.8]
CANDIDATE --> COOLDOWN : [count == 3]\n/ emit CONFIRMED(cls)

COOLDOWN --> IDLE : 1.5 s elapsed
COOLDOWN : all images ignored

note right of CANDIDATE
  3 consecutive images of the same class
  at ~280 ms per image => ~0.85 s
  gesture-to-action (NFR-PERF-03)
end note
@enduml
